@baseUrl = http://localhost:9377
@accessToken = {{socialLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@fileId = {{uploadImage.response.body.$.data.fileId}}

# 업로드 전용 테스트 유저 (시드와 무관). 시드 file_id는 100~104 (images/…, videos/…).
# 피드·스토리 등에서 쓸 때는 시드 로그인(google-myultary-test-001) + fileId 100~104.

### 0. 소셜 로그인 (토큰 확보)
# @name socialLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "GOOGLE",
  "providerUserId": "google-file-test-001",
  "email": "file.test@example.com",
  "name": "파일테스트"
}

### 1. 이미지 업로드 (AUTO)
# (= 2·3번과 동일 API) POST /api/v1/files · FileController.upload · mediaType=AUTO
# @name uploadImage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/sample.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mediaType"

AUTO
--WebAppBoundary--

### 2. 이미지 업로드 (mediaType=IMAGE 명시)
# (= 1·3번과 동일 API) POST /api/v1/files · mediaType=IMAGE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./fixtures/sample.png
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mediaType"

IMAGE
--WebAppBoundary--

### 3. 영상 업로드 (mediaType=VIDEO)
# (= 1·2번과 동일 API) POST /api/v1/files · mediaType=VIDEO
# @name uploadVideo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./fixtures/sample.mp4
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mediaType"

VIDEO
--WebAppBoundary--

### 4. 메타 조회
# (= 7번과 동일 API) GET /api/v1/files/{fileId}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files/{{fileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. 바이너리 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files/{{fileId}}/content
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. 소프트 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files/{{fileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. 삭제 후 메타 조회 (404 예상)
# (= 4번과 동일 API) GET /api/v1/files/{fileId}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/files/{{fileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
